data: {"id": "a149f2d120b84351-thinking-parallel_evidence-798", "run_id": "a149f2d120b84351", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将直接执行既定证据计划中的 Kubernetes 工具（describe、previous logs、events、yaml），并结合已采集的 Metrics/Logging/Tracing baseline 进行事实确认。\n\n### 执行计划中的 Kubernetes 工具\n\n1.  **kubectl describe pod** - 查看 Last State、Exit Code、Reason\n2.  **kubectl previous logs** - 查看崩溃前容器日志\n3.  **kubectl events** - 查看 BackOff、probe failed、Killing 事件\n4.  **kubectl get pod -o yaml** - 检查 command/args/image/resources\n\n同时，我会记录已采集的可观测性事实。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788796942443, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

