链\n\n```text\n应用运行模式配置为 FAILURE_MODE=config_missing_exit → 处理请求时抛出 CONFIG_MISSING 错误并返回 500 → 进程主动以退出码 78 终止 → Kubelet 检测非零退出码触发重启，最终导致 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：应用 `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 被显式配置为 `FAILURE_MODE=config_missing_exit` 模式。在此模式下，应用代码在接收到 `/work` 请求时，因检测到配置缺失主动触发 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，返回 HTTP 500 状态码，并随后以退出码 `78` 终止进程。这种设计导致容器不断异常退出，进而引发 Kubernetes 的指数退避重启机制，使得 Pod 持续处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态 [证据 3, 4, 5, 1]。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 68.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 68.6s (Evidence 58.0s, RCA 10.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 103.786, "metrics": {"run_id": "a149f2d120b84351", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 103.7932677268982, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "46%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "d